@frankvgompel @kick-ban-ignore @LuciferUchiha (+others that +1'd the comments above) I would recommend creating a new issue with a minimally reproducible example of the bug.

The original code snippet posted in this issue doesn't seem to run into an error for me, so I would guess that the root-causes of the issues still being seen are likely different from the one that this issue was originally filed for, even if the final error being thrown is coming from the same line.

Please tag me in the newly created issue so that I don't miss it
